xmodel/sol-toric.md:162:On that factor the chosen 56 base rows span the accepted rank-56 base system, so this is also the verdict for all 76 raw rows and their degree-one multiples. This is an exact characteristic-zero **consistency** certificate for the tier, not merely a modular guess. It is deliberately not claimed uniform over every (E)-factor. The shipped run took 35.1 seconds, with about 694 MiB maximum RSS (about 943 MiB peak footprint).
