xmodel/grok-thmB-review.md:79:- \(R_0,R_{10},R_{30},R_{40}\) vanish for **arbitrary** \(r,Q\) once (8) is used (dummy exact polynomials; no square-lift needed). \(R_{30}=-2(rG_{20})'+8(aG_{10})'=0\) is the \(6pa\leftrightarrow\frac32 par\) cancellation. \(R_{40}\) self-pair \(48p'a^2+36paa'\) cancels the \(G_{40}=b\) linearization. Support of (9) admits only slots \(0,10,20,30,40\) below 42.
