xmodel/sol-h5a.md:11:1. **PROVED — H5a is resolved as a uniform global convention.** At a doubly realized vertex, the only uniform presentation-independent repair compatible with the thesis's integer decoration, Notation 3.11, and its explicit use in Proposition 5.5 is the **Q/jump/max value**
