xmodel/codex-eval-20260812.md:5439:./ZHEGLOV-SCOPE.md:30:**R4. String-equation correspondence for NON-coprime orders (S5, esp. T:one-to-one-correspondence & inverse, 2620–2790).** Extends A. Schwarz's coprime-order bijection; needed precisely because subrectangular DC-pairs have non-coprime orders. Feeds R:distinguished_coefficient (distinguished coefficient =0, via Newton–Puiseux + Wilson, rank-1). Formal-series existence/uniqueness/normalization arguments; the whole transport of the DC-pair to the Puiseux-series side rests here.
xmodel/codex-eval-20260812.md:5440:./ZHEGLOV-SCOPE.md:56:- **T3. Machinery on non-vacuous objects**: automorphism pairs (φ(x),φ(∂)) in A_1 and Burchnall–Chaundy rank-1 commuting pairs; compute normal forms to finite order; test L:Q_p tail shape, termination + non-maximal distance (intro's claim), S5 cut/glue roundtrip, distinguished-coefficient=0 (R:distinguished_coefficient). ~10-20 agent-h. Tests R4 + S2 end-to-end where hypotheses are satisfiable.
